{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"الدرس 387. الكلمات الجديدة: continuait، sacrée، bases، vélos، contrariée، demanderai، inévitable، former، classes، parent، apparences، faiblesse."},{"btype":"example","text":"continuait = تَابَعَ","note":"صيغة من continuer (الغائب، الماضي المستمرّ)؛ مثال: Sami continuait à bouger — استمرّ سامي في الحركة."},{"btype":"example","text":"sacrée = مُقَدَّس","note":"صيغة من sacré (المؤنث)"},{"btype":"example","text":"bases = أَسَاس، قَاعِدَة","note":"صيغة من base (الجمع)"},{"btype":"example","text":"vélos = دَرَّاجَة","note":"صيغة من vélo (الجمع)؛ مثال: Ils n'avaient pas besoin de vélos. — لم يحتاجوا إلى دراجات."},{"btype":"example","text":"contrariée = مُنْزَعِج","note":"صيغة من contrarié (المؤنث)؛ مثال: Tu es contrariée. — أنت منزعج."},{"btype":"example","text":"demanderai = سَأَلَ","note":"صيغة من demander (المتكلّم، المستقبل)؛ مثال: Je lui demanderai. — سوف أسأله"},{"btype":"example","text":"inévitable = حَتْمِيّ","note":"مثال: Je crains que ce soit inévitable. — أخشى بأنه لا يمكن تجنبه."},{"btype":"example","text":"former = دَرَّبَ","note":""},{"btype":"example","text":"classes = صِنْف، طَبَقَة","note":"صيغة من classe (الجمع)"},{"btype":"example","text":"parent = وَالِد","note":"مثال: Il est difficile d'être parent. — من الصعب أن تكون والداً."},{"btype":"example","text":"apparences = مَظْهَر، شَكْل","note":"صيغة من apparence (الجمع)؛ مثال: Il ne faut pas se fier aux apparences. — لا تحكم بظواهر الأمور."},{"btype":"example","text":"faiblesse = ضَعْف","note":"مثال: John a tiré avantage de la faiblesse de Bill. — استغلّ جون ضعف بيل."},{"btype":"text","text":"جمل الدرس:"},{"btype":"example","text":"Tu es contrariée.","note":"أنت منزعج."},{"btype":"example","text":"Je lui demanderai.","note":"سوف أسأله"},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami continuait à bouger","note":"استمرّ سامي في الحركة."},{"btype":"example","text":"Il est difficile d'être parent.","note":"من الصعب أن تكون والداً."},{"btype":"example","text":"Je crains que ce soit inévitable.","note":"أخشى بأنه لا يمكن تجنبه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ils n'avaient pas besoin de vélos.","note":"لم يحتاجوا إلى دراجات."},{"btype":"example","text":"Il ne faut pas se fier aux apparences.","note":"لا تحكم بظواهر الأمور."},{"btype":"example","text":"John a tiré avantage de la faiblesse de Bill.","note":"استغلّ جون ضعف بيل."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ne vas-tu pas y aller ?","note":"ألن تذهب؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"C'est le livre de Tony.","note":"ذلك كتاب طوني."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":5,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.write","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.listen","count":2,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.truefalse","count":2,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"fr","lang_name":"الفرنسية","sentences":[{"t":"Tu es contrariée.","ar":"أنت منزعج."},{"t":"Je lui demanderai.","ar":"سوف أسأله"},{"t":"Sami continuait à bouger","ar":"استمرّ سامي في الحركة."},{"t":"Il est difficile d'être parent.","ar":"من الصعب أن تكون والداً."},{"t":"Je crains que ce soit inévitable.","ar":"أخشى بأنه لا يمكن تجنبه."},{"t":"Ils n'avaient pas besoin de vélos.","ar":"لم يحتاجوا إلى دراجات."},{"t":"Il ne faut pas se fier aux apparences.","ar":"لا تحكم بظواهر الأمور."},{"t":"John a tiré avantage de la faiblesse de Bill.","ar":"استغلّ جون ضعف بيل."},{"t":"Ne vas-tu pas y aller ?","ar":"ألن تذهب؟"},{"t":"C'est le livre de Tony.","ar":"ذلك كتاب طوني."},{"t":"Jane vient d'Australie.","ar":"جين من أستراليا."},{"t":"Que lui est-il arrivé ?","ar":"ما الذي حصل له؟"}],"focus":["continuait","sacrée","bases","vélos","contrariée","demanderai","inévitable","former","classes","parent","apparences","faiblesse"],"words":[{"word":"inévitable","topic":"L387","difficulty":3,"meaning":"حَتْمِيّ","example":"Je crains que ce soit inévitable.","translation":"أخشى بأنه لا يمكن تجنبه."},{"word":"former","topic":"L387","difficulty":3,"meaning":"دَرَّبَ"},{"word":"parent","topic":"L387","difficulty":3,"meaning":"وَالِد","example":"Il est difficile d'être parent.","translation":"من الصعب أن تكون والداً."},{"word":"faiblesse","topic":"L387","difficulty":3,"meaning":"ضَعْف","example":"John a tiré avantage de la faiblesse de Bill.","translation":"استغلّ جون ضعف بيل."}],"difficulty":3}}